{"corpus":"ccc","number":368,"text_html":"<span>La tradition spirituelle de l’Église insiste aussi sur le <i class=\"typo_italic\">cœur<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§478</sup><sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§2517</sup><sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§2562</sup></i>, au sens<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§582</sup> biblique de « fond de l’être » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup> où la personne se décide ou non pour<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§1431</sup><sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§1764</sup> Dieu <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"2\">2</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">3</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">4</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"5\">5</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">6</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">7</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">8</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["478","582","1431","1764","2517","2562"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Jr 31:33"},{"text":"Dt 6:5"},{"text":"Dt 29:3"},{"text":"Is 29:13"},{"text":"Ez 36:26"},{"text":"Mt 6:21"},{"text":"Lc 8:15"},{"text":"Rm 5:5"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"Jr 31:33","idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Dt 6:5","idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"29:3","idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Is 29:13","idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ez 36:26","idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"Mt 6:21","idx":6},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 8:15","idx":7},{"type":"bible","raw":"Rm 5:5","idx":8}]}